PASS record_format_supported: version 1 legacy generator inputs; version 2 explicit setup inputs and resolution reopens
PASS summary_matches_raw: summary.json recomputed from samples.jsonl
PASS provenance_present: executable/source hashes, host, rustc, command and params consistent
PASS release_build_only: build_profile "release"; debug-build evidence needs --allow-debug-build
PASS scenarios_exited_cleanly: ingest, history, layers, contention exited 0
PASS no_errors_outside_contention: 0 error samples
PASS ingest_ids_stable_and_inventoried: 300 contents, 270 unique objects
PASS history_advances_sequential: 30 advances
PASS layer_captures_applied: capture outcomes
PASS disk_probes_complete_and_nonempty: initialized repositories have bytes/files; incomplete traversal fails the scenario
PASS clone_storage_not_payload_proportional: 24 clones grew stored bytes by Some(0) in total; shared payload 1048576
PASS contention_used_distinct_processes: 4 workers, 4 distinct pids
PASS retries_repeat_exact_input_after_uncertain_errors: every action starts at 0 and repeats identical worker/input after its uncertain failure
PASS every_retry_followed_a_recorded_reopen: each retry consumes its own successful, ordered reopen; no orphan reopen
PASS worker_actions_match_fixture_and_final_evidence: all worker/index actions present; setup objects, observed head and blob inputs bind final evidence
PASS every_operation_has_durable_outcome: 0 unresolved
PASS one_ordered_winner_per_version: 73 history entries, 72 accepted operations
PASS history_matches_acknowledged_accepts: every accept present once with its operation and manifest; no unexplained winner
PASS stale_outcomes_never_create_versions: stale actual head > expected and operation absent from history
PASS integrity_matches_history_and_attempts: check(): {"attempts":118,"layers":0,"objects":467,"versions":73}
PASS same_operation_retry_returns_identical_outcome: 118 retried operations
PASS operation_id_reuse_rejected: same ID with different manifest
PASS every_blob_put_has_durable_outcome: 80 blob puts with a final outcome; 0 not acknowledged
PASS acknowledged_blobs_read_back_exactly: 80 acknowledged puts, 80 read back, 50 distinct contents
PASS contention_errors_are_only_busy: 0 error samples; any non-busy storage error or reused operation ID fails the run
PASS advance_expected_matches_observed_head: each first attempt used the head its worker had just read
PASS stale_actual_respects_real_time_order: stale actual is at least every version acknowledged before that attempt started
PASS integrity_objects_match_recorded_puts: 466 distinct recorded objects plus the World 0 manifest vs check() 467
PASS replay_left_repository_files_unchanged: repository file hash before and after replaying every operation
PASS workers_completed_and_all_operations_recorded: 4 worker_end markers; 100 executed vs 100 recorded operations
PASS not_truncated_by_budget: a truncated run is incomplete evidence
PASS no_mismatch_outcomes: 0 mismatch samples
PASS clone_heads_and_layer_count_checked: 24 clone checks, 1 layer count checks
VERIFY: all recorded invariants hold
